chapter.v:
And sons 


were born, 


to David at Hebron: his firstborn was Amnon, of Ahinoam of Jezreel;

and his 


second, Chileab,, 


of Abigail the widow of Nabal of Carmel; and the third, Absalom the son of Maacah the daughter of Talmai king of Geshur;

and the 


fourth, Adonijah, 


the son of Haggith; and the fifth, Shephatiah the son of Abital;
